{"n": 600, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "600.webp", "text": "32-5la\n4. Scrapping “Airbag” Vehicles:\n\nIn accordance with accident prevention regulations “airbag” gas generators must be\nrendered unusable prior to scrapping. This is necessary since the gas generator is 3\nPyrotechnical object and could cause injury if activated incorrectly (for example\nwith 8 torch during scrapping). Airbag gas generators must be ignited in the vehicles\nmeant for scrapping from the outside and with doors of vehicles closed. The igniter,\nSpecial Too! 62 1 270, developed by BMW must be dsed for this purpose.\n\nNon-ignited generators are a source of danger (also for the environment)!\n\n1, Remove lower section of steering column casing and disconnect airbag plug\n(orange).\n\n2. Connect airbag plug and igniter together.\n3. Connect igniter on a 12 V battery placed 10 meters (32 feet) away from car.\n\n4. Keep as far away from car as the length of the igniter’s lead — always stand in\nfront of car (this also concerns other persons).\n\n5. Operate switch of igniter.\n\nCaution!\n\nThe burning off of the solid fuel will heat the airbag unit — danger of burning\nhands!\n\nWash hands after touching ignited generators!", "words": [["32-5la", 0.4706, 0.0252, 0.5456, 0.0491], ["4.", 0.0213, 0.069, 0.0304, 0.0796], ["Scrapping", 0.0527, 0.0663, 0.1013, 0.0882], ["“Airbag”", 0.1054, 0.067, 0.1469, 0.0882], ["Vehicles:", 0.1505, 0.0696, 0.194, 0.0809], ["In", 0.0552, 0.1074, 0.0648, 0.1167], ["accordance", 0.0679, 0.1074, 0.1201, 0.118], ["with", 0.1231, 0.1074, 0.1439, 0.118], ["accident", 0.1469, 0.1081, 0.1874, 0.1187], ["prevention", 0.1905, 0.1088, 0.2421, 0.1207], ["regulations", 0.2457, 0.1081, 0.2979, 0.122], ["“airbag”", 0.3019, 0.1088, 0.4387, 0.122], ["gas", 0.3455, 0.1048, 0.3612, 0.1247], ["generators", 0.3647, 0.1088, 0.4129, 0.122], ["must", 0.4179, 0.1048, 0.4382, 0.1247], ["be", 0.4422, 0.1101, 0.4534, 0.12], ["rendered", 0.0547, 0.1207, 0.0947, 0.1412], ["unusable", 0.0998, 